This font uses an old cross-stitch chart from the book  Ouvrages de Dames, Album No. 321, published by  Sajou  around 1880






Scans of this book are found at https://www.antiquepatternlibrary.org/html/warm/C-PR005-02.htm where they are shared under the Creative Commons Licence CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0

